#: src/window.rs:1106
msgid ""
"After each dictation the HUD shows for a second how long the text took after "
"the stop."
msgstr "每次听写后，悬浮窗会显示 1 秒钟，告诉你停止后生成文本用了多长时间。"

#: src/window.rs:1110
msgid ""
"The HUD shows the words as you speak, recognized again every half second. "
"The text pasted is still recognized from the whole recording after the stop. "
"On by default on a Mac or with a discrete GPU: an integrated one is kept "
"busy while you speak."
msgstr ""
"说话时悬浮窗会显示文字，每半秒重新识别一次。粘贴的文本仍会在停止后根据完整录"
"音识别。在 Mac 或配有独立 GPU 的电脑上默认打开：集成 GPU 会在你说话时一直被占"
"用。"

#: src/window.rs:1115
msgid ""
"Frees the model's memory after Wavo has been idle this long. The next "
"dictation loads it again, which takes a moment."
msgstr ""
"Wavo 闲置达到此时长后，释放模型占用的内存。下次听写时会重新加载，需要片刻。"

#: src/window.rs:1119
msgid ""
"Models marked ANE run on the Neural Engine: as fast as on the GPU at a "
"fraction of the energy. Each new version of Wavo prepares such a model once, "
"in the background (10–30 s); meanwhile it runs on the GPU. Other models "
"always run on the GPU."
msgstr ""
"标有 ANE 的模型在 Neural Engine 上运行：速度与 GPU 相当，能耗却低得多。每个新"
"版本的 Wavo 会在后台为此类模型准备一次（10–30 秒），在此期间它在 GPU 上运行。"
"其他模型始终在 GPU 上运行。"

#: src/window.rs:1124
msgid ""
"A .zip that Wavo exported, here or on another computer: the dictations this "
"history does not have are added with their recordings; the settings stay as "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"Wavo 在本机或其他电脑上导出的 .zip：此历史记录中没有的听写会连同录音一起添"
"加；设置保持不变。"

#: src/window.rs:1128
msgid ""
"The history, its recordings and the settings, into a .zip archive: Import "
"brings it back, here or on another computer."
msgstr ""
"将历史记录、录音和设置导出为 .zip 归档：用“导入”可在本机或其他电脑上恢复。"

#: src/window.rs:1132
msgid "Off while the history is kept until Wavo quits"
msgstr "历史记录仅保留到 Wavo 退出时不可用"

#: src/window.rs:1134
msgid ""
"Deletes every dictation saved on disk and its recording. The ones kept until "
"Wavo quits stay."
msgstr "删除磁盘上保存的所有听写及其录音。保留到 Wavo 退出的听写不受影响。"

#: src/window.rs:1138
msgid "No dictations saved"
msgstr "没有已保存的听写"

#: src/window.rs:1140
msgid "Deleted once the dictation, export or import ends"
msgstr "将在听写、导出或导入结束后删除"

#: src/window.rs:1143
msgid ""
"Wavo looks for a new version at launch and once a day; the menu says when "
"there is one. Off, it looks only when you choose Check for Updates."
msgstr ""
"Wavo 会在启动时及每天检查一次新版本，有新版本时菜单会提示。关闭后，只在你选择"
"“检查更新”时检查。"

#: src/window.rs:1146
msgid "This copy of Wavo doesn’t update itself."
msgstr "此 Wavo 副本不会自动更新。"

