#: src/window.rs:1404
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Models: the downloaded models, in the Hugging Face cache, which other apps "
"that use Hugging Face models share. Deleting a model on Models frees its "
"space.\n"
"{models}\n"
"\n"
"Recordings: the audio of every dictation in the history, a folder a day. A "
"dictation deleted from the history takes its recording with it.\n"
"{recordings}"
msgstr ""
"模型：已下载的模型，位于 Hugging Face 缓存中，与其他使用 Hugging Face 模型的 "
"App 共享。在“模型”中删除模型即可释放其空间。\n"
"{models}\n"
"\n"
"录音：历史记录中每条听写的音频，每天一个文件夹。从历史记录中删除听写时，其录"
"音也会一并删除。\n"
